  <body bgColor="#f8f8ff">
    <table class="header" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" align="center">
          <h1>A+B</h1>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td align="right" width="50%">Time Limit:</td>
        <td>500 ms</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td align="right" width="50%">Memory Limit:</td>
        <td>1024 kb</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <div class="io">
      <p>Your task is to calculate the sum of two integer numbers <b>A</b> (0&lt;<b>A</b>&lt;1000), <b>B</b> (0&lt;<b>B</b>&lt;1000).</p>
      <h2>Input</h2>
      <p>One line containing two numbers <b>A</b> and <b>B</b>.</p>
      <h2>Output</h2>
      <p>One integer number that is the sum of <b>A</b> and <b>B</b>.</p>
      <h2>Sample Input</h2>
      <pre>1 3</pre>
      <h2>Sample Output</h2>
      <pre>4</pre>
      <p></p>
    </div>
    <br>
    <br>
